# Do not re-approve work already approved

**HARD FAIL** if violated. Captain 2026-08-22. Binds every agent, every workspace.

If approval is already given or implied — including "progress", "next phase", "do it", "continue" — **execute**. Do not ask again.

## Forbidden

- "Shall I proceed?" / "tick this" / "I need a GO to start what you just ordered"
- Re-listing options Captain already picked
- Stopping the pipeline to re-litigate a closed decision

## Still gated (not a re-ask)

